<title>USA: Hinsdale Financial Corp Q1 Dec 31 net up.</title>
<headline>Hinsdale Financial Corp Q1 Dec 31 net up.</headline>
<dateline>HINSDALE, Ill. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.38		    $0.37</p>
<p> Shr primary	     $ 0.39		    $0.37</p>
<p> Net			  1,079		    1,022</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 2,805		    2,795</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 2,802		    2,795</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: As previously reported, Hinsdale Financial expects to complete its merger of equals transaction with Liberty Bancorp in the 1997 Q1. In anticipation of that transaction, it changed its fiscal year-end to December from September. The current quarter represents the first and only quarter of the partial year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
